# Reports and artifacts
# Every path under reports/ is generated - runs, the registry, the active-run
# pointer, comparison.json - and `artifacts.py` creates the tree it needs, so one
# rule covers the lot. Enumerating them let `comparison.json` land untracked-but-
# stageable, and kept three empty directories alive from the pre-bundle layout.
reports/
outputs/
mlruns/

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
